<urn:atm:triage:finding/AD9-ERRKIND-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AD9-ERRKIND-001" ;
  triage:title "AtmError::member_not_found() misclassified under AtmErrorKind::Validation instead of established not-found precedent" ;
  triage:description "AD.9-QA-1 verdict (important, RBP-F001) on branch feature/pAD-s9-update-member-cli-and-roster-repair-path (PR #457) reports the new AtmError::member_not_found() constructor is classified under AtmErrorKind::Validation, inconsistent with the established AgentNotFound/TeamNotFound not-found error-kind precedent elsewhere in the codebase." ;
